			 /yindex y 1 add 2 div bpside mul cvi def
			 bstring yindex bwidth mul xindex 8 idiv add get
			 1 7 xindex 8 mod sub bitshift and 0 ne FrameNegative {not} if
			 {/onbits  onbits  1 add def 1}
			 {/offbits offbits 1 add def 0}
			 ifelse
